<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN 2007 OLO AUCTIONED AT AVERAGE 5.838 PCT.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN 2007 OLO AUCTIONED AT AVERAGE 5.838 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the</p>
<p>following details about the outcome of its monthly auction -</p>
<p>* 6.25 pct, 28 March 2007 </p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   103.067 / 5.838 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    102.000 to 103.100</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 103.05 </p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     100</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		   16.425 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	    25.275 billion francs</p>
<p>* 5.00 pct, 28 March 2001 OLO</p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   102.171 / 4.413 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    102.100 to 102.200</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 102.150</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     58.296</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		    8.020 billion francs</p>
<p>    Total amount of bids	    16.205 billion francs</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
